   "fix": "Say instead that without continuity, `kp > 2` cannot be dropped at `k = 1` (`u = |z|^{-2/5}`, `p = 4/3`). Note that for continuous `u` at `k = 1`, `MemWkpLoc.contDiffOn_comp` covers every `p`. Alternatively, delete the sentence.",
